{"unit_id":"tag:03Q4:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回忆，若<MATH_0001>是层（sheaves）的图式（diagram），定义于景（site）<MATH_0002>上，其余极限（colimit）（在层（sheaves）的范畴（category）中）是预层（presheaf）<MATH_0003>的层化（sheafification）。参见《景（Sites）》引理<REF_0001>。若这个系统有向（directed），<MATH_0004>为拟紧（quasi-compact）对象（object），属于<MATH_0005>，它有由拟紧（quasi-compact）对象（objects）组成的覆盖（coverings）的余终（cofinal）系统，则<MATH_0006>，参见《景（Sites）》引理<REF_0002>。关于阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的余极限（colimits）的高阶上同调群（cohomology groups）的结果，参见《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0003>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n在《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0004>中，我们将这个结果推广到景（sites）的逆系统（inverse system）上的层（sheaves）系统。这里给出相应概念，针对平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）层（sheaves）的系统，它们定义于概形（schemes）的逆系统（inverse system）上。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"directed","target_term":"有向"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"cofinal","target_term":"余终"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"étale"