{"unit_id":"tag:0EZL:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为预序集合（preordered set）。设<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）的逆系统（inverse system），定义于<MATH_0003>上。一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>系统（system）<MATH_0004>，由层组成（of sheaves），定义于<MATH_0005>上<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，由以下数据给出：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对所有<MATH_0008>之前的指标，指定层（sheaf）<MATH_0006>，定义于<MATH_0007>上，对所有<MATH_0008>均如此，\n<STRUCT_0003> 对<MATH_0009>，给出映射（map）<MATH_0010>，由层组成（of sheaves），定义于<MATH_0011>上，\n<STRUCT_0004>\n使得<MATH_0012>，只要<MATH_0013>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"preordered set","target_term":"预序集合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"of sheaves","target_term":"由层组成"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"of sheaves","target_term":"由层组成"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"preordered set","target_term":"预序集合","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"of sheaves","target_term":"由层组成","context":"暂译，来源声明核心。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03Q4:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在定义<REF_0001>的情形，假设<MATH_0001>是有向集合（directed set），且转移态射（transition morphisms）<MATH_0002>仿射（affine）。设<MATH_0003>为极限（limit），取在概形（schemes）的范畴（category）中，参见《极限（Limits）》第<REF_0002>节。用<MATH_0004>表示投影态射（morphisms），并考虑映射（maps）<MATH_0005>。这使<MATH_0006>成为层（sheaves）的系统，定义于<MATH_0007>上，以<MATH_0008>为指标（核实这一点是个很好的练习）。我们常想知道是否存在同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0009>。将会证明，若<MATH_0010>拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated），对所有<MATH_0011>均如此，则这是真的，参见定理<REF_0003>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"directed set","target_term":"有向集合"},{"source_term":"transition morphisms","target_term":"转移态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Limits","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"投影态射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"directed set","target_term":"有向集合","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"transition morphisms","target_term":"转移态射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Limits","target_term":"极限","context":"章节引用。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"投影态射","context":"投影的态射。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_t